Largest element in an array

class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
            int[] arr={10,20,30,40,50};
            int largest=arr[0];
            for(int i=1;i<arr.length;i++)
            {
                if(arr[i]>largest)
                {
                    largest=arr[i];
                }
            }
            System.out.println("Largest element is:"+largest);
    
        }
    } 

Largest element is:50
